You move along the animal path pretty fast. It's quite easy, you don't even have to move branches apart. You are surrounded by short bushes, richly studded with white flowers. They are so numerous, so you can hardly see leaves. Their smell is rather nice.
You almost covered halfway. Thickets become more dense. Your eyesight catches some new plants. Those are short, one meter high bushes, with beautiful lilac flowers. A pleasant sweetish smell is coming from them. Strange, but there is almost no grass under these bushes. While the bushes with white flowers form rather dense living wall, lilac bushes grow quite sparsely. You need to decide, whether you go through the thickets of white bushes or try to go through the lilac ones.   